"movie\",\"overview\":\"A New York stockbroker refuses to cooperate in a large securities fraud case involving corruption on Wall Street, corporate banking world and mob infiltration. Based on Jordan Belfort's autobiography.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":150540,\"title\":\"Inside Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2H1TmgdfNtsKlU9jKdeNyYL5y8T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jJKZaTBNenlFclQyjrnvzkRmvWE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When 11-year-old Riley moves to a new city, her Emotions team up to help her through the transition. Joy, Fear, Anger, Disgust and Sadness work together, but when Joy and Sadness get lost, they must journey through unfamiliar places to get back home.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1248832,\"title\":\"Digger\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1ATXKrIPJyKNwnJ6lcG088Sa6zi.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4A3r1AjJg9Wa6ms3MGOScetCY0o.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The most powerful man in the world embarks on a frantic mission to prove he is humanity's savior before the disaster he's unleashed destroys everything.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1314481,\"title\":\"The Devil Wears Prada 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fCAURTUx3YfsJ8k9I0UamjSILiR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dRoFlUbH1l51ACmx5oPCI3jfvZq.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Andy Sachs returns to Runway as Miranda Priestly navigates a new media landscape and Runway's position within. The duo reconnect with former assistant Emily Charlton, now the head of a luxury brand that possesses funding which could ensure Runway's survival.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":313369,\"title\":\"La La Land\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uDO8zWDhfWwoFdKS4fzkUJt0Rf0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nlPCdZlHtRNcF6C9hzUH4ebmV1w.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mia, an aspiring actress, serves lattes to movie stars in between auditions and Sebastian, a jazz musician, scrapes by playing cocktail party gigs in dingy bars, but as success mounts they are faced with decisions that begin to fray the fragile fabric of their love affair, and the dreams they worked so hard to maintain in each other threaten to rip them apart.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":466272,\"title\":\"Once Upon a Time in... Hollywood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8j58iEBw9pOXFD2L0nt0ZXeHviB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kKTPv9LKKs5L3oO1y5FNObxAPWI.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Los Angeles, 1969. TV star Rick Dalton, a struggling actor specializing in westerns, and stuntman Cliff Booth, his best friend, try to survive in a constantly changing movie industry. Dalton is the neighbor of the young and promising actress and model Sharon Tate, who has just married the prestigious Polish director Roman Polanski…\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":77338,\"title\":\"The Intouchables\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1QU7HKgsQbGpzsJbJK4pAVQV9F5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q6OGlZ1KMEb14AC8KbPCxyNOal6.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A true story of two men who should never have met – a quadriplegic aristocrat who was injured in a paragliding accident and a young man from the projects.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":120467,\"title\":\"The Grand Budapest Hotel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eWdyYQreja6JGCzqHWXpWHDrrPo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jK65srQczOKTpW62wPxwwKztGgE.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Grand Budapest Hotel tells of a legendary concierge at a famous European hotel between the wars and his friendship with a young employee who becomes his trusted protégé. The story involves the theft and recovery of a priceless Renaissance painting, the battle for an enormous family fortune and the slow and then sudden upheavals that transformed Europe during the first half of the 20th century.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1088548,\"title\":\"Bitter Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kiPGcHX0YT49nrab76G0bqw3gHW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ppLv2F7dhvI3wxaEoOP1E0OyBPP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a long December holiday weekend, a woman, whose mother has recently died, throws herself into work as a form of escape. Her relentless pace is interrupted when a panic attack forces her to take a break.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1325734,\"title\":\"The Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1oKLEA9JOhvaBwLpqjROisvWMy7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A happily engaged couple is put to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"PLUjuJpaTOU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}